# EI-CF + ROBOT

This directory contains the paper implementation of EI-CF active search with
ranked ROBOT trust regions in normalized simulator-output space.

The Gaussian-process models map the six simulator inputs to intermediate
outputs. EI-CF estimates expected detectability using Monte Carlo posterior
samples, while ROBOT processes the output-space regions in rank order and
excludes candidates that violate diversity relative to higher-ranked regions.
Selected NMMA simulations can be evaluated concurrently.

The included CSV files provide the initial O5a/O5b/O5c training data. NMMA SVD
models and the prior file are not stored in this repository.

## Environment

```bash
export NMMA_WORKDIR=/path/to/nmma/source/checkout
export SVD_PATH=/path/to/svdmodels
export PRIOR_FILE=/path/to/priors/Bu2019lm.prior
export OUTPUT_BASE="$PWD/out"
```

`NMMA_SVD_PATH`, `NMMA_PRIOR_FILE`, and `BO_OUTPUT_BASE` are accepted as
backward-compatible aliases.

## Paper configuration

```bash
python -u run_bo.py \
  --seed 1 \
  --n-iterations 80 \
  --output-folder out/eicf_all_regions_seed1 \
  --acquisition ROBOT_EICF \
  --robot-distance-mode tail_l1 \
  --robot-tau-quantile 75 \
  --robot-initial-length 0.6 \
  --robot-success-tolerance 10 \
  --robot-failure-tolerance 32 \
  --robot-n-regions 5 \
  --robot-batch-regions 5 \
  --robot-candidates-per-region 1 \
  --parallel-simulations 5 \
  --candidate-samples 1500 \
  --eicf-mc-samples 16 \
  --eicf-batch-size 512 \
  --refit-output-gps \
  --output-gp-refit-every 1 \
  --skip-detection-gp-refit \
  --no-plots \
  --checkpoint-every 1 \
  --scoring-progress-every 0
```

This uses five ranked regions, selects at most one event per region, runs up to
five simulations concurrently, and refits the output GPs after every completed
batch. `--n-iterations` counts BO batches; each batch produces zero to five
events depending on feasibility.

The base pool contains 1,500 uniform inputs because the uniform count equals
the total candidate count. 

## Multiple seeds

```bash
python -u run_multi_seed.py \
  --seeds 1-3 \
  --n-iterations 80 \
  --output-root out/paper_eicf_robot \
  --no-plots
```

Resume an interrupted run with identical settings and `--resume`.
